Package: wanglinux-server
Version: 1.0.0-1~aurora1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 10
Depends: wanglinux-base (>= 1.0.0), wanglinux-tools (>= 1.0.0), openssh-server,
 rsync, cron, htop, ufw, fail2ban, unattended-upgrades, curl, ca-certificates,
 sudo, tmux, vim-tiny | nano, zsh | bash-completion
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wanglinux/wanglinux
Description: WangLinux server (meta package)
 One install turns a bare Debian 12 into a WangLinux server: SSH, cron,
 firewall (ufw), fail2ban, unattended security upgrades, monitoring tools
 and the WangLinux toolbox.
 .
 Intended for VPS / cloud / containers / ARM boards running headless.
